{"seq":2,"slug":"agile-development","title":"大学软件工程 — 敏捷开发方法","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/engineering/software-engineering/software-process/agile-development","wordCount":1995,"readingTime":8,"html":"<h1 id=\"大学软件工程-敏捷开发方法\">大学软件工程 — 敏捷开发方法</h1><h2 id=\"知识要点\">知识要点</h2><p>敏捷开发（Agile Development）是一组以<strong>迭代交付、持续反馈和自组织团队</strong>为核心的软件开发方法论的统称。2001 年，17 位软件开发者在美国犹他州签署了《敏捷宣言》（Agile Manifesto），确立了四条核心价值观和十二条原则，从此敏捷从一种实践经验上升为一场席卷全球的软件开发范式变革。</p>\n<p>敏捷方法的诞生是对传统&quot;重型&quot;过程（如瀑布模型和 CMM 过程改进）的反思。传统方法强调<strong>计划驱动</strong>——在开发开始前尽可能完整地定义需求和设计；敏捷方法则承认软件开发的<strong>内在不确定性</strong>，主张通过短周期迭代和频繁交付来适应变化。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>敏捷核心价值</th>\n<th>含义</th>\n<th>对应传统实践</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>个体和互动 &gt; 流程和工具</td>\n<td>人是软件开发的核心驱动力</td>\n<td>过程制度化</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>可工作的软件 &gt; 详尽的文档</td>\n<td>交付可运行的软件是衡量进度的首要标准</td>\n<td>文档驱动</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>客户合作 &gt; 合同谈判</td>\n<td>与客户建立持续协作关系</td>\n<td>合同约束</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>响应变化 &gt; 遵循计划</td>\n<td>拥抱需求变更作为竞争优势</td>\n<td>变更控制委员会</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>注意：敏捷宣言的措辞是&quot;虽然右项有其价值，但我们更重视左项&quot;——这并非否定文档、计划和流程，而是在面对权衡时优先选择左项。</p>\n<h2 id=\"详细讲解\">详细讲解</h2><h3 id=\"scrum-最流行的敏捷框架\">Scrum：最流行的敏捷框架</h3><p>Scrum 是当前使用最广泛的敏捷框架，由 Ken Schwaber 和 Jeff Sutherland 于 1990 年代发展而成。Scrum 定义了三个角色、五个事件和三个工件：</p>\n<p><strong>三个角色</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Product Owner（产品负责人）</strong>：负责维护 Product Backlog，决定功能优先级，代表业务价值</li>\n<li><strong>Scrum Master</strong>：服务型领导者，负责移除团队障碍，维护 Scrum 流程</li>\n<li><strong>Development Team（开发团队）</strong>：跨职能的自组织团队，通常 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>∼</mo><mn>9</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">3 \\sim 9</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">3</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∼</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">9</span></span></span></span></span> 人</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>五个事件</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Sprint</strong>：固定时长的迭代周期（通常 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>∼</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1 \\sim 4</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∼</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">4</span></span></span></span></span> 周）</li>\n<li><strong>Sprint Planning</strong>：团队选取 Backlog 条目并制定 Sprint 目标</li>\n<li><strong>Daily Standup</strong>：每日 15 分钟站会，同步进展与障碍</li>\n<li><strong>Sprint Review</strong>：向利益相关者展示 Sprint 成果</li>\n<li><strong>Sprint Retrospective</strong>：团队反思流程改进点</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>三个工件</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Product Backlog</strong>：按优先级排序的需求列表</li>\n<li><strong>Sprint Backlog</strong>：当前 Sprint 选取的工作条目</li>\n<li><strong>Increment</strong>：Sprint 结束时交付的可潜在发布的产品增量</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Scrum 的核心节奏可以用 Sprint 的<strong>燃尽图</strong>（Burndown Chart）来跟踪。假设一个 Sprint 有 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>S</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">S</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span></span></span></span></span> 个故事点，Sprint 时长为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>T</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span></span></span></span></span> 天，理想燃尽线为：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>B</mi><mtext>ideal</mtext></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mi>S</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mfrac><mi>t</mi><mi>T</mi></mfrac><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">B_{\\text{ideal}}(t) = S \\cdot \\left(1 - \\frac{t}{T}\\right)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0502em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">ideal</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.4em;vertical-align:-0.95em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size3\">(</span></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.2921em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size3\">)</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>实际燃尽曲线与理想线的偏差可以反映团队的工作节奏是否稳定。</p>\n<h3 id=\"看板方法-流动效率的极致追求\">看板方法：流动效率的极致追求</h3><p>看板（Kanban）方法源自丰田生产系统的&quot;看板&quot;概念，由 David Anderson 引入软件开发领域。与 Scrum 的固定迭代不同，看板关注的是<strong>工作的持续流动</strong>。</p>\n<p>看板的核心实践：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>可视化工作流</strong>：将工作项在看板上从左到右移动（如 待办 → 进行中 → 审核 → 完成）</li>\n<li><strong>限制在制品（WIP）</strong>：为每个阶段设置并行工作上限，防止过度多任务切换</li>\n<li><strong>管理流动</strong>：监控前置时间（Lead Time）和周期时间（Cycle Time）</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Little&#39;s Law 是看板方法的数学基础，它描述了稳态系统中三个关键指标的关系：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>L</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>λ</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mi>W</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L = \\lambda \\cdot W</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>L</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span></span></span></span></span> 为系统中的平均在制品数量，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>λ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\lambda</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span></span></span></span></span> 为平均吞吐率，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>W</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">W</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span></span></span></span></span> 为平均前置时间。由此可推导：降低 WIP 限制 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>L</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span></span></span></span></span>，在吞吐率 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>λ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\lambda</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span></span></span></span></span> 不变的前提下，平均前置时间 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>W</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">W</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span></span></span></span></span> 也会降低。</p>\n<h3 id=\"极限编程-xp-技术实践的敏捷\">极限编程（XP）：技术实践的敏捷</h3><p>极限编程（eXtreme Programming）由 Kent Beck 提出，是最强调<strong>技术卓越</strong>的敏捷方法。XP 的核心实践包括：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>结对编程</strong>（Pair Programming）：两人共用一台电脑，一人编码（Driver）一人审查（Navigator）</li>\n<li><strong>测试驱动开发</strong>（TDD）：先写测试，再写使测试通过的最少代码，然后重构</li>\n<li><strong>持续集成</strong>（CI）：频繁地将代码集成到主干，每次集成都通过自动化测试验证</li>\n<li><strong>简单设计</strong>：只实现当前所需的最简单方案，避免过度设计</li>\n<li><strong>重构</strong>：在不改变外部行为的前提下，持续改善代码的内部结构</li>\n</ul>\n<p>TDD 的&quot;红-绿-重构&quot;循环是 XP 最具标志性的实践，它从根本上改变了&quot;先编码后测试&quot;的传统开发节奏。</p>\n<h3 id=\"敏捷度量-速度与预测\">敏捷度量：速度与预测</h3><p>敏捷团队常用<strong>速度</strong>（Velocity）作为预测工具。速度定义为团队在一个 Sprint 中完成的故事点总和。经过若干 Sprint 后，速度趋于稳定，可以用来预测项目完成时间。</p>\n<p>假设 Product Backlog 中剩余的总故事点为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span></span></span></span></span>，团队的平均速度为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>v</mi><mo>ˉ</mo></mover></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\bar{v}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5678em;\"></span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.5678em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.2222em;\"><span class=\"mord\">ˉ</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，则预计还需的 Sprint 数为：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi><mo>=</mo><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">⌈</mo><mfrac><mi>P</mi><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>v</mi><mo>ˉ</mo></mover></mfrac><mo fence=\"true\">⌉</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N = \\left\\lceil \\frac{P}{\\bar{v}} \\right\\rceil</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.4em;vertical-align:-0.95em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size3\">⌈</span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.5678em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.2222em;\"><span class=\"mord\">ˉ</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size3\">⌉</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>需要注意，速度是<strong>团队级别</strong>的预测工具，不应用于个人绩效评估，否则会导致&quot;故事点通胀&quot;等博弈行为。</p>\n<h3 id=\"scrum-vs-kanban-对比\">Scrum vs. Kanban 对比</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>Scrum</th>\n<th>Kanban</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>节奏</td>\n<td>固定长度 Sprint</td>\n<td>持续流动</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>角色</td>\n<td>PO / SM / Dev Team</td>\n<td>无强制角色</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>变更策略</td>\n<td>Sprint 内不变更</td>\n<td>随时可加入新条目</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>度量</td>\n<td>速度（Velocity）</td>\n<td>前置时间 / 吞吐量</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>WIP 限制</td>\n<td>隐式（Sprint 容量）</td>\n<td>显式（每列 WIP 上限）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>适用场景</td>\n<td>产品开发、功能迭代</td>\n<td>运维、支持、持续交付</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"练习与思考\">练习与思考</h2><ol>\n<li><p>一个 Scrum 团队在最近 5 个 Sprint 中完成的故事点分别为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>21</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>18</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>24</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>20</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>22</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">21, 18, 24, 20, 22</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8389em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">21</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">18</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">24</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">20</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">22</span></span></span></span></span>。Product Backlog 中剩余 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>130</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">130</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">130</span></span></span></span></span> 个故事点。计算团队的平均速度 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>v</mi><mo>ˉ</mo></mover></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\bar{v}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5678em;\"></span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.5678em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.2222em;\"><span class=\"mord\">ˉ</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，并预测还需多少个 Sprint 才能完成所有需求。</p>\n</li>\n<li><p>某团队的看板有&quot;开发&quot;和&quot;测试&quot;两个阶段。开发阶段 WIP 限制为 4，测试阶段 WIP 限制为 2。当前开发阶段有 4 个任务，测试阶段有 1 个任务。新来一个紧急需求，产品经理要求立即开始开发。请分析根据看板规则应如何处理这种情况。</p>\n</li>\n<li><p>结对编程在很多组织中推行困难，管理者认为&quot;两个人做一个人的工作是浪费&quot;。请从代码质量、知识传播、团队韧性三个角度反驳这一观点。</p>\n</li>\n<li><p>敏捷宣言诞生于 2001 年，至今已超过 20 年。有人认为敏捷已经&quot;过时&quot;，被 DevOps、SRE 等新范式取代。你同意这一观点吗？请论述你的看法。</p>\n</li>\n<li><p>TDD 要求先写测试再写代码，但初学者常常不知道&quot;测试什么&quot;。请为一个简单的用户注册功能设计 TDD 的测试用例列表（至少 5 个测试场景）。</p>\n</li>\n</ol>\n<h2 id=\"拓展阅读\">拓展阅读</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>Beck, K. et al. (2001). &quot;Manifesto for Agile Software Development&quot;</strong>（agilemanifesto.org）：敏捷宣言原文，是理解敏捷哲学的起点。</li>\n<li><strong>《Scrum 指南》（Schwaber &amp; Sutherland）</strong>：Scrum 的官方定义文档，篇幅精短但信息密度极高。</li>\n<li><strong>《解析极限编程》（Kent Beck）</strong>：XP 创始人的经典著作，深入解释每项技术实践的原理。</li>\n<li><strong>Anderson, D. (2010). &quot;Kanban: Successful Evolutionary Change for Your Technology Business&quot;</strong>：看板方法在软件行业的权威著作。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>敏捷开发方法代表了软件工程从&quot;计划驱动&quot;向&quot;价值驱动&quot;的范式转变。Scrum 提供了结构化的迭代框架，看板追求流动效率的极致，XP 将技术卓越作为核心竞争力。这些方法并非互斥，现实中团队往往根据自身特点混合使用（如 Scrumban）。理解敏捷不仅是学习一组实践，更是培养一种拥抱变化、持续改善的工程思维。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"大学软件工程 — 敏捷开发方法","id":"大学软件工程-敏捷开发方法"},{"level":2,"text":"知识要点","id":"知识要点"},{"level":2,"text":"详细讲解","id":"详细讲解"},{"level":3,"text":"Scrum：最流行的敏捷框架","id":"scrum-最流行的敏捷框架"},{"level":3,"text":"看板方法：流动效率的极致追求","id":"看板方法-流动效率的极致追求"},{"level":3,"text":"极限编程（XP）：技术实践的敏捷","id":"极限编程-xp-技术实践的敏捷"},{"level":3,"text":"敏捷度量：速度与预测","id":"敏捷度量-速度与预测"},{"level":3,"text":"Scrum vs. Kanban 对比","id":"scrum-vs-kanban-对比"},{"level":2,"text":"练习与思考","id":"练习与思考"},{"level":2,"text":"拓展阅读","id":"拓展阅读"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"大学软件工程 — 软件生命周期","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/engineering/software-engineering/software-process/software-lifecycle"},"next":{"title":"大学软件工程 — 需求工程","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/engineering/software-engineering/software-process/requirements-engineering"}}